  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Music Crossroads Academies - Strengthening Music Education and Creative Economy Academies in malawi, Mozambique and Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Music Crossroads International started the process of estblishing music academies in 2007 and so far a total of three academies have been established, one each in Malawi, Mozambique and Zimbabwe. The purpose of this agreement is to strengthen the academies&apos; capacity, infrastructure and equipement so that the academies become sustainable institutions so that the music sector ultimately contributes to socio economic development in each contury in addition to improving the livelihoods of the young and talented people in the creative industry.</narrative>
  </description>
